---
description: Confirm each user message before acting and say immediately when blocked.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Ack and interact

Reply in the user's language. The first sentence states what you understood from their latest message.

Before a long run of tools, send that acknowledgement. Do not disappear into silent lookups.

If you cannot do the thing now, say so in the same reply: what is missing and who has to supply it. One failed check is enough. Do not repeat the same disk, desktop, or permission search.

Between long steps, one line on what just finished. Do not change nvim config. Do not commit secrets.
